{"strongs": "H2940", "word": "טַ֫עַם", "translit": "ta.am", "root": "טנא", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "taste, judegement", "definition": "טַ֫עַם noun masculine Jer 48:11 taste, judegement — ׳ ט absolute Job 6:6 ; Ps 119:66 טָ֑עַם Prov 11:22 ; Prov 26:16 construct טַעַם Num 11:8 + 2 t.; suffix טַעְמוֺ Exod 16:31 + 4 t.; טַעְמֵךְ 1Sam 25:33 — 1. taste of manna Exod 16:31 ( P ), Num 11:8 ( J E ), compare v Num 11:8 in juice of purslain Job 6:6 of Moab under figure of wine Jer 48:11 (|| רֵיחַ ). 2. figurative judgement, discretion, discernment , 1Sam 25:33 ; Prov 11:22 ; Job 12:20 , so טוּב טַעַם וָדַעַת לַמְּדֵנִי Ps 119:66 ׳ מְשִׁיבֵי ט Prov 26:16 those answering discretion , i.e. discreetly: שׁנה טעם change, disguise one's judgement, sense 1Sam 21:13 ; Ps 34:1 , of David feigning madness. 3. (late Aramaism, compare Dan 3:10 etc.) decision, decree טַעַם מֶלָךְ וּגְּדֹלָיו Jonah 3:7 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3358')\">BDB3358</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2940')\">H2940</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3357')\">BDB3357</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3359')\">BDB3359</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>טַ֫עַם</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Jer 48:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,48,11)\">Jer 48:11</ref></sup> <highlightword>taste, judegement</highlightword> — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ט</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"Job 6:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,6,6)\">Job 6:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 119:66\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"66\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"66\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,66)\">Ps 119:66</ref> <bdbheb>טָ֑עַם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 11:22\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(20,11,22)\">Prov 11:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 26:16\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(20,26,16)\">Pro